Historical generals and admirals for France that the base game leaves out, each with a portrait painted from a period photograph. The first release adds three generals and one admiral who served with the Allies in the French liberation forces of 1942-45; more will follow.

[h2]Companion mod: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3832953557]Event Pack: France[/url][/h2]
Historical flavor events for France, from the same author.

[h1]Info:[/h1]
- Works alone and beside any other Commanders Pack.
- Adds characters, so it changes the game checksum: not Ironman compatible.
- Needs a new game.
